        <p source="#source-18217-18513"><seg source="#source-18217-18220">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18220-18235"><rb>暑</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18235-18241">さに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18241-18256"><rb>變</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18256-18283">りはないんです、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18283-18310"><rb>互樣</rb><rt>たがひさま</rt></ruby>。」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18319-18343"><rb>唯吉</rb><rt>たゞきち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18343-18349">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18349-18373"><rb>道理</rb><rt>もつとも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18373-18388">らしいが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18388-18403"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18403-18409">がお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18409-18436"><rb>互樣</rb><rt>たがひさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18436-18448">なのか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18448-18466"><rb>相應</rb><rt>そぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18466-18475">はない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18475-18490"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18490-18493">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18493-18505"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18505-18513">ふ。</seg></p>
