        <p source="#source-24825-25232"><seg source="#source-24825-24828">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24828-24852"><rb>成程</rb><rt>なるほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24852-24855">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24855-24870"><rb>蟲</rb><rt>むし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24870-24873">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24873-24891"><rb>梟</rb><rt>ふくろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24891-24897">では</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24897-24918"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24918-24942"><rb>見當</rb><rt>けんたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24942-24945">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24945-24960"><rb>違</rb><rt>ちが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24960-24981">ひました。……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24981-24996"><rb>續</rb><rt>つゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24996-25002">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25002-25017"><rb>餘</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25017-25020">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25020-25035"><rb>暑</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25035-25047">いので、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25047-25068"><rb>餘程</rb><rt>よほど</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25068-25083"><rb>茫</rb><rt>ばう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25083-25092">として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25092-25104"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25104-25122">るやうです。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25122-25146"><rb>失禮</rb><rt>しつれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25146-25149">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25149-25167"><rb>可厭</rb><rt>いや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25167-25185">なものツて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25185-25200"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg sourc