        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-52347-52628"><seg source="#source-52347-52362">どんなに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52362-52380"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52380-52383">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52383-52407"><rb>厚顏</rb><rt>あつかま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52407-52437">しうござんしたつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52437-52458"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52458-52461">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52461-52476"><rb>蟲</rb><rt>むし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52476-52479">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52479-52491"><rb>捕</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52491-52500">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52500-52512"><rb>棄</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52512-52518">てて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52518-52533"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52533-52563">さいなんぞと、そんな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52563-52578"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52578-52581">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52581-52596"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52596-52628">されますものですか。</seg></p>
