        <p source="#source-60102-60434"><seg source="#source-60102-60105">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60105-60123"><rb>否</rb><rt>いゝえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60123-60126">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60126-60144"><rb>可厭</rb><rt>いや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60144-60147">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60147-60162"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60162-60165">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60165-60177"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60177-60210">いたんです……そして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60210-60222"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60222-60225">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60225-60240"><rb>晩</rb><rt>ばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60240-60243">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60243-60267"><rb>可恐</rb><rt>おそろし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60267-60273">い、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60273-60291"><rb>氣味</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60291-60294">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60294-60309"><rb>惡</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60309-60312">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60312-60327"><rb>坊</rb><rt>ばう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60327-60339">さんに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60339-60363"><rb>忌々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-60348-60354">いま</seg><choice source="#source-60354-60360"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60363-60369">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60369-60384"><rb>鉦</rb><rt>かね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60384-60387">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60387-60402"><rb>叩</rb><rt>たゝ</rt></ruby>かれましたから……」</p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-60434-60573"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60437-60461"><rb>唯吉</rb><rt>たゞきち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60461-60467">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60467-60482"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60482-60491">はず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60491-60506"><rb>乘</rb><rt>のつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60506-60518">かゝつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60518-60530"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60530-60533">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60533-60548"><rb>胸</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60548-60551">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60551-60563"><rb>引</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60563-60573">く。</seg></p>
